          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ilagho kwa wundu ghwa Ikanisa ja Pergamo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na malaika wa ikanisa ja Pergamo kumuandikie huwu: ‘Agha ni malagho gha uo uko na lufu lukalie chia rose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namanya andu kukaiagha; ni andu kifumbi cha nguma cha Shetani chiko. Oho kwamaziriane nani, hata ndekorejikanieghe irumirio japo hata kwa agho matuku gha Antipa mshahidi wapo na mloli wapo; uo orebwaghiloghe aghadi konyu, andu Shetani ukaiagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela neko na malagho matini aighu yako: kokwanye na wandu wamu aho wawuyanugha mafundisho gha Balaamu uo oremfundishireghe Balaki kuwikuwara wandu wa Israeli, eri wipate kuja vindo vifunyiro kizongona kwa milimu, na kukuzaisira kulaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
